      "text": "third son of Lehi1, older brother of Nephi1, 1 Ne. 2:5. is told of the Lord’s manifestations by Nephi1, 1 Ne. 2:17. elder brothers rebel against Nephi1 and Sam, 1 Ne. 7:6 (Alma 3:6). Lehi1 rejoices because of Sam, 1 Ne. 8:3. is admonished to hearken unto Nephi1, 2 Ne. 1:28. is blessed by Lehi1, 2 Ne. 4:11. goes with Nephi1, 2 Ne. 5:6.",
